From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Arun Iyengar <aiyengar1990@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 11:17:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 310/311] fate/vc1: update the SMM0005 reference for the
 Simple/Main B-picture fixes

"avcodec/vc1_mc: fix FASTUVMC rounding of interpolated backward chroma
MVs" and "avcodec/vc1_pred: pull back the co-located MV of Simple/Main
direct mode" change the decoded B pictures of SMM0005 (frames 9, 11, ...,
21), which their commit messages report now match the SMPTE reference
decoder. The FATE reference is FFmpeg's own earlier output, so update it.
All other FATE tests are unchanged.

Signed-off-by: Arun Iyengar <aiyengar1990@gmail.com>
---
 tests/ref/fate/vc1test_smm0005 | 14 +++++++-------
